# E8b -- full question, plain cross-entropy. The ablation that separates E8's two changes:
#   E8b vs E0  = what the full question (and the 1024-token context it needs) is worth
#   E8  vs E8b = what Balanced Softmax + focal loss cost
# Identical to E8 except the loss; identical to E0 except the input and context.

# unchanged from E0
--model microsoft/deberta-v3-large
--epochs 8
--batch-size 16
--lr 1e-5
--head-lr 1e-4
--llrd 0.95
--loss ce

# changed from E0 (same as E8): the full journalist question, and room for it
--input full
--max-len 1024
--a-budget 256

# operational (E8 measured a 14.9 GB peak at 1024 tokens)
--max-vram-gb 16
--save-model
--push-to-hub
